const content="<article class=\"sn-page\" data-editorial-version=\"4\"><div class=\"sn-read\"><a href=\"/supporters/\">Featured sponsors</a><p class=\"sn-kicker\">Marine Diesel Engine \u00b7 Sponsor feature</p><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/bushman/logo.png\" alt=\"Bushman logo\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\"><h1>Bushman portable refrigeration for the weekend after engine service</h1><p class=\"sn-intro\">A serviced diesel gets the yacht out of the marina. A cold galley makes staying away for the weekend considerably nicer. For owners whose boat still has a basic icebox, Bushman&#x27;s portable compressor chest is a way to carry milk, fresh ingredients and a prepared dinner aboard without making the next project a full galley rebuild.</p><img class=\"sn-hero\" src=\"/images/supporters/bushman/SC35-52_Camping.webp\" alt=\"A Bushman Original portable fridge/freezer at camp\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1620\" loading=\"lazy\"><section><h2>Find a spot that leaves the engine accessible</h2><p>Before buying, open the companionway steps and lift the engine cover as you would during a check. Now measure for the fridge. A chest that fits neatly on paper may have to be moved every time you inspect the engine. Look for a secure spot with clear ventilation and enough room above the lid to lift a loaded basket. Keep the unit away from unnecessary machinery heat.</p><p>The Original Bushman has a fixed floor footprint with several lid and collar arrangements. We like that for older yachts where width is non-negotiable. Work out whether the main job is chilled provisions or frozen meals. Bushman specifies the 35, 42 and 45 litre configurations for whole-chest freezer use.</p></section><img class=\"sn-hero\" src=\"/images/supporters/bushman/Original_Bushman_52.webp\" alt=\"Bushman Original in the taller 52 litre configuration\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1620\" loading=\"lazy\"><section><h2>Know what happens after the diesel stops</h2><p>The Original operates from a suitable 12 or 24 volt supply. Starting a trip with a chilled chest and cold food reduces the initial cooling work. At anchor, the compressor draws from the house system as it cycles. Measure consumption over a typical day instead of assuming yesterday&#x27;s motoring has replaced every amp-hour. Take Bushman your available dimensions, supply voltage and normal weekend menu. That&#x27;s a sound starting point for choosing a setup you&#x27;ll use on almost every trip.</p></section><p><a rel=\"sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://bushman.com.au/\">Compare Bushman portable fridge/freezers \u2197</a></p></div></article>";
